		(at 304.8 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0f607bc4-341f-5164-8f24-de2687968ebc")
	)
	(text "- Rails: external +V/-V ~ +/-15.6 V loaded (12-0-12 VAC 100 VA, 216-253 V mains: ~14.1 V valley to 20.3 V no-load). +VF/-VF = front-end rails via R3/C3, R4/C4."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 250.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "176e20d7-7190-5917-a5cd-484b3e68b700")
	)
	(text "VAS / MILLER COMP. / FEEDBACK"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 156.21 63.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1c8ac2e9-458c-56f9-976f-b279d1e80052")
	)
	(text "Q10-Q13 on the main heatsink, insulated."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 243.84 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1da33eb6-3ad7-54f1-8826-892f3ffe9b16")
	)
	(text "- Topology: complementary LTP input (Q1/Q2, Q3/Q4) -> push-pull VAS (Q7/Q8, Miller C5/C6) -> VBE multiplier Q9 -> complementary-feedback-pair output (Q10+Q12, Q11+Q13)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2a30a327-3a94-5b13-a413-6ccf4b2f4eec")
	)
	(text "C3/C4 at the input stage and VAS."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 142.24 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "52b5b4d1-c189-5bec-8f92-9951c82259fc")
	)
	(text "ClassA2 Rev A - Hiraga-inspired complementary Class-A amplifier, ONE MONO CHANNEL (build two boards)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "889f4f52-7d86-5374-8337-a2c97a09d93a")
	)
	(text "BIAS GENERATOR"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 203.2 63.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "939026c3-40a5-53c5-a240-18c9d820e6b0")
	)
	(text "INPUT"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 16.51 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "978db6f8-9c17-5cfa-8f84-2c48fbc299dd")
	)
	(text "Q12/Q13 tabs are EP/EN, not a rail."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 243.84 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9e4f82f2-ef7f-5a8f-8190-6ce5dfe42395")
	)
	(text "- Ground: one GND net. Return C9, R1, C2 and J1 screen to the input-ground point, C10/J3/C11-C14 to the power-ground point; join them at J2 pin 2."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 265.43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aaced2a3-4705-55f4-9163-1b68120f8635")
	)
	(text "- No output short-circuit protection. Speaker protection (relay, DC detect, turn-on delay >= 3 s) is external, between J3 and the speaker."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 269.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bbdf6160-6ca1-50a1-ad8f-014581c43037")
	)
	(text "C11-C14 at the output-pair emitters (Q12/Q13)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 142.24 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d61a2fff-5d7c-5571-9265-52a90ed84b33")
	)
	(text "- Heatsink: Q9, Q10, Q11, Q12, Q13 on one insulated heatsink per channel, <=1.2 K/W (about 22 W per channel at idle). Q12/Q13 tabs are at EP/EN, NOT at a rail."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 261.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d7597497-ca95-5491-bc7f-d73da8aaebe4")
	)
	(text "- Bias: target 0.70 A per channel when warm = 231 mV across R22 (TP5-TP4) and R25 (TP4-TP6). Class A to ~7.5 W into 8 ohm; class AB above."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 15.24 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
